Subject: [PATCH] kbuild: Update documentation of clean-files and clean-dirs
Date: Thu,  8 Jan 2015 14:49:26 +0100
Message-Id: <1420724966-20865-1-git-send-email-mmarek@suse.cz>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.1.2
